From: genshanxinli <127909456+genshanxinli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: mediatek: init LEDs state on AN7581

an7581_phy_probe() omitted mtk_phy_leds_state_init(phydev), leaving
priv->led_state uninitialized unlike mt7981_phy_probe() and
mt7988_phy_probe() (issue #388). Call mtk_phy_leds_state_init(phydev) right
after assigning phydev->priv.

Origin: xr1710g-v2 (#388)
Signed-off-by: genshanxinli <127909456+genshanxinli@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/phy/mediatek/mtk-ge-soc.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/mediatek/mtk-ge-soc.c
@@ -1443,6 +1443,8 @@ static int an7581_phy_probe(struct phy_d
 
 	phydev->priv = priv;
 
+	mtk_phy_leds_state_init(phydev);
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
